{"id":"H4601","lemma":"מַעֲכָה","transliteration":"maakhah","sayIt":"ma-a-KHAH","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Maacah","meaning":"A man living at the time of the Patriarchs, only mentioned at Gen.22.24;\nson of: Nahor (H5152H) and Reumah (H7208);\nbrother of: Tebah (H2875), Gaham (H1514) and Tahash (H8477);\nhalf-brother of: Uz (H5780H), Buz (H0938), Kemuel (H7055), Chesed (H3777), Hazo (H2375), Pildash (H6394), Jidlaph (H3044) and Bethuel (H1328A)\n§ Maachah = \"oppression\"\nson of Nahor by concubine Reumah","glosses":["maacah","maacath"],"count":23,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"gen-22","v":24,"renderings":{"bsb":"and Maacah"}},{"chapterId":"jos-13","v":13,"renderings":{"bsb":"and Maacath","kjv":"and the Maachathites"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-3","v":3,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Maacah","kjv":"of Maacah"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-10","v":6,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Maacah","kjv":"Maacah"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-10","v":8,"renderings":{"bsb":"and Maacah","kjv":"and Maacah"}},{"chapterId":"1ki-2","v":39,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Maacah","kjv":"of Maachah"}},{"chapterId":"1ki-15","v":2,"renderings":{"bsb":"was Maacah","kjv":"was Maachah"}},{"chapterId":"1ki-15","v":10,"renderings":{"bsb":"was Maacah","kjv":"was Maachah"}},{"chapterId":"1ki-15","v":13,"renderings":{"bsb":"Maacah","kjv":"And also Maachah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-2","v":48,"renderings":{"bsb":"Maacah","kjv":"Maachah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-3","v":2,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Maacah","kjv":"of Maachah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-7","v":15,"renderings":{"bsb":"was Maacah","kjv":"was Maachah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-7","v":16,"renderings":{"bsb":"Maacah","kjv":"And Maachah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-8","v":29,"renderings":{"bsb":"was Maacah","kjv":"was Maachah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-9","v":35,"renderings":{"bsb":"was Maacah","kjv":"was Maachah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-11","v":43,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Maacah","kjv":"of Maachah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-19","v":6,"renderings":{"kjv":"and out of Syriamaachah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-19","v":7,"renderings":